# Allow-list: only what the image build needs. Everything else stays out of
# the build context - in particular the station secrets (doa_settings.json
# holds the KrakenPro API key and the station location, api_token,
# server.key) and the 1.4 GB local uWebSockets clones (the Dockerfile fetches
# a pinned copy). librtlsdr is cloned at a pinned commit by the Dockerfile too.
*
!docker/
!heimdall_v2/Makefile
!heimdall_v2/config.h
!heimdall_v2/index.html
!heimdall_v2/src/
!heimdall_v2/external/
!kraken_doa_v2/Makefile
!kraken_doa_v2/include/
!kraken_doa_v2/src/
!kraken_doa_v2/kraken_doa.html
!kraken_doa_v2/array_calculator.html
!kraken_doa_v2/opus-decoder.js
!kraken_doa_v2/opus-decoder.min.js
!kraken_doa_v2/plugins/
kraken_doa_v2/plugins/*/build/
kraken_doa_v2/plugins/sdk/build/
